# M13 "Üç Yurt" client presentation (docs/PROTOCOL_ZONES.md §7), run 1 of flow "zones"
# (tools/dev/run-ui-flows.ps1: StartZone = 0, homelands on; --fixed-dt 0.0333). A new Aydor warrior
# starts in Tanyeri (banner), walks up the north road to the Eşik gate (label within 40 m, veil, the
# near-gate hint within 8 m), passes it (gate screen "Geçitten geçiliyor…", loading screen "Ortaocak
# yükleniyor…", banner + arrival line in Ortaocak), looks back at the Aydor gate of Ortaocak, walks
# through it home again, sees a (locally simulated) failed zone change, and leaves to the character
# list ("Savaşçı · Tanyeri"). The screens of a zone change are held 1.5 s each (`scene zonehold`) so
# the screenshots catch them; players never wait for that.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m13_zones
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Sinirci
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+zone2 1800
# ---- Tanyeri: the banner at the top, the zone name in the HUD ----
expect world+banner
expecttext world.zone Tanyeri
scene expectgates 1
wait 30
screenshot 01_tanyeri_banner.png
waitfor world+ready+nobanner 400
expect world+nogatehint

# ---- Up the north road: the gate label from 40 m, the veil in the opening ----
scene walktogate 1 26
waitfor world+nodest+standing 3600
scene facegate 1 12 9
wait 10
expect world+gatelabel
scene expectgatelabel Ortaocak Geçidi
scene expectveils 1
expect world+nogatehint
screenshot 02_tanyeri_gate_label.png

# ---- 6 m in front: the hint near the bottom ----
scene walktogate 1 6
waitfor world+nodest+standing 1200
scene facegate 1 10 8
wait 10
scene expectgatehint Geçide yürü: Ortaocak
expect world+gatehint
screenshot 03_tanyeri_gate_hint.png

# ---- Through the gate: gate screen, loading screen, Ortaocak with banner and arrival line ----
scene zonehold 1.5 1.5
scene walktogate 1 0
waitfor world+gatescreen 900
wait 6
screenshot 04_gate_screen_to_ortaocak.png
waitfor world+loading+zone1 600
wait 6
screenshot 05_loading_ortaocak.png
waitfor world+ready+idle+zone1 1800
scene expectzonemessage Ortaocak bölgesine geçtin.
scene expectcombatmessage Ortaocak bölgesine geçtin.
expect world+banner
expecttext world.zone Ortaocak
scene expectnear 282.32 219.49 3
scene expectgates 2
wait 20
screenshot 06_ortaocak_arrival_banner.png

# ---- Looking back at the Aydor gate of Ortaocak (8 m behind the arrival point) ----
scene zonehold 0 0
waitfor world+ready+nobanner 400
scene facegate 2 8 13
wait 10
scene expectgatelabel Tanyeri Geçidi
scene expectgatehint Geçide yürü: Tanyeri
scene expectveils 2
screenshot 07_ortaocak_aydor_gate.png

# ---- Home again through it ----
scene walktogate 2 0
waitfor world+ready+idle+zone2 1800
scene expectnear 256.85 432.31 3
scene expectzonemessage Tanyeri bölgesine geçtin.
expect world+banner
wait 30
screenshot 08_tanyeri_return.png

# ---- A failed zone change (simulated locally): back where we stood, the line, moving again ----
waitfor world+ready+nobanner 400
scene zonehold 1.0 0
scene zonefail 1
waitfor world+gatescreen 120
wait 5
screenshot 09_gate_screen_failed.png
waitfor world+ready+idle+zone2 300
expect world+nobanner
scene expectzonemessage Geçit şu an kullanılamıyor, tekrar dene.
scene expectcombatmessage Geçit şu an kullanılamıyor
scene expectnear 256.85 432.31 3
wait 5
screenshot 10_failed_change_message.png
scene zonehold 0 0
scene walkrel 0 -6
waitfor world+nodest+standing 600
scene expectfar 256.85 432.31 4

# ---- The character list names the zone ----
key escape
waitfor world+menu 60
clickon world.menu.charselect
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1+selected0 900
expecttext select.slot0 Tanyeri
screenshot 11_select_tanyeri.png
quit
